    options: []
    conditions:
    - kind: 6
      key: 
      value:
        type: 0
        boolValue: 0
        intValue: 0
        stringValue: 
      dialogueId: 
      nodeId: intro.ask
      choiceId: 
    elseNext: intro.1
  - id: intro.1
    kind: 0
    text: Whirr-whirr! A real Guardian of Mathematics! I saw your compass-blade glinting
      from the rooftops!
    emote: 1
    next: intro.2
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: intro.2
    kind: 0
    text: 'I''m Birdy. My rotor runs on pure geometry: one perfect circle, spinning
      very, very fast.'
    emote: 0
    next: intro.3
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: intro.3
    kind: 0
    text: Say... could a Guardian spare a moment for a small bird with a big problem?
    emote: 2
    next: intro.ask
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: intro.ask
    kind: 1
    text: 
    emote: 0
    next: 
    options:
    - id: help
      text: Of course. What's wrong?
      next: help.1
      conditions: []
      whenUnmet: 0
      effects:
      - kind: 0
        key: birdy.promised_help
        value:
          type: 0
          boolValue: 1
          intValue: 0
          stringValue: 
    - id: newton
      text: Do you know anything about Newton?
      next: newton.1
      conditions:
      - kind: 7
        key: 
        value:
          type: 0
          boolValue: 0
          intValue: 0
          stringValue: 
        dialogueId: 
        nodeId: intro.ask
        choiceId: newton
      whenUnmet: 0
      effects: []
    - id: later
      text: Sorry, I'm in a hurry.
      next: later.1
      conditions: []
      whenUnmet: 0
      effects: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: help.1
    kind: 0
    text: Whirr! Thank you! Newton's apples knocked my lucky protractor clean off
      the roof!
    emote: 1
    next: help.2
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: help.2
    kind: 0
    text: It landed somewhere in the courtyard. Find it, and I'll show you a shortcut
      up the tower!
    emote: 2
    next: 
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: newton.1
    kind: 0
    text: Sir Isaac? He paces the courtyard all day, muttering about falling bodies...
    emote: 2
    next: newton.2
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: newton.2
    kind: 0
    text: His gravity wells will drag you in. But his weak spot is the inverse square.
      Distance is everything.
    emote: 2
    next: newton.3
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: newton.3
    kind: 0
    text: Halve the distance and your blows land four times as hard! So get close.
      Brave-close!
    emote: 1
    next: newton.4
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: newton.4
    kind: 0
    text: And when the apples start raining, watch the ground for their marks. Now,
      about that favour...
    emote: 0
    next: intro.ask
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: later.1
    kind: 0
    text: No worries! I'll be right here. Standing, not hovering. Hovering is tiring.
    emote: 0
    next: 
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: back.promised
    kind: 0
    text: You came back! Still up for helping?
    emote: 1
    next: back.ask
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: back.ask
    kind: 1
    text: 
    emote: 0
    next: 
    options:
    - id: yes
      text: Still looking! Where did it fall?
      next: back.where
      conditions: []
      whenUnmet: 0
      effects: []
    - id: no
      text: Actually, I can't right now.
      next: back.no
      conditions: []
      whenUnmet: 0
      effects:
      - kind: 0
        key: birdy.promised_help
        value:
          type: 0
          boolValue: 0
          intValue: 0
          stringValue: 
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: back.where
    kind: 0
    text: 'Near the courtyard well, I think. You can''t miss it: it''s a perfect
      half-circle!'
    emote: 2
    next: 
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: back.no
    kind: 0
    text: Oh. Well... the offer stands. My protractor isn't going anywhere. Probably.
    emote: 2
    next: 
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  - id: back.again
    kind: 0
    text: Oh! The Guardian again! Changed your mind about that favour?
    emote: 0
    next: intro.ask
    options: []
    conditions: []
    elseNext: 
  lines: []
